  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;<strong>需要安装Minecraft Forge。</strong></span></p><p><strong>自1.19.2-5.2.0版本起，建议同时使用</strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></a></span>&nbsp;</strong></span><strong>。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;本模组添加了大量日式方块、物品、实体等内容。</p><p>若要获取更多关于本模组的信息，请阅读 <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fonl.bz%252fMVGfr7Y\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Japan Wiki（日本語/Japanese）</a><span style=\"color:#fff\">。</span></span></p><p>如需报告问题或提出疑问，请通过 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.gd%252f3Y5fx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iwaliner 联系专用Discord服务器</a></strong></span> 告知我。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>增加大量和风建材、食物等。<br>魔法元素目前正在开发中，尚不完善。</p><p><strong>自1.19.2-5.2.0版本起，推荐同时安装</strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></span> </strong></span><strong>。可获得解说手册。</strong><br>想了解漆MOD的合成配方、教程等详细信息，请参阅<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.gd%252fwTGkx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">漆MOD的Wiki</a></span></strong>。</p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/wR5qf7JprH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">漆MOD官方Discord服务器</a></span></strong>也已开放。<br>问题报告、提问及其他联系请通过<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.gd%252f3Y5fx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iwaliner联系专用Discord服务器</a></span></strong>。<br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fiwaliner.booth.pm%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Booth</a></span>有售漆MOD官方周边商品！</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>关于漆MOD的其他链接 ↓　↓</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforum.civa.jp%252fviewtopic.php%253ft%253d1170\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Japan Forum（日本語/Japanese）</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fonl.bz%252fMVGfr7Y\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Japan Wiki（日本語/Japanese）</a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mcmod.cn%252fclass%252f8924.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC百科（中文/Chinese）</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://twitter.com/iwaliner_MC\" rel=\"nofollow\">作者Twitter（日本語/Japanese）</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GI3jkGKb0AAFYyn?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" width=\"563\" height=\"294\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fl3_hbOaMAEzE3T?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" alt=\"Slide Doors\" width=\"563\" height=\"331\"></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fxd-nUJaUAAzxzd?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" width=\"563\" height=\"316\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/Fj2CYYmUoAAxQfn?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" alt=\"connectable blocks\" width=\"563\" height=\"331\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FhFdqbLUcAEBUkJ?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" alt=\"gate for Kakuriyo dimension\" width=\"563\" height=\"294\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FNEp3eraAAAZjMT?format=png&amp;name=900x900\" width=\"563\" height=\"317\">&nbsp; 在水田里种植水稻！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FeoYblaVEAANO_F?format=jpg&amp;name=medium\" width=\"563\" height=\"563\">&nbsp; 培育日本孟宗竹！</p><p>在土炉上煮饭！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FgcbZQbUYAA1t4Z?format=jpg&amp;name=large\" alt=\"cave in Kakuriyo dimension\" width=\"563\" height=\"294\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
